# Windsurf / Cascade Rules — Persistent 2-Tier Memory System

## Mandatory Memory Protocol
- Always read `memory.md` before taking action.
- Update Section 2 in `memory.md` with critical architectural lessons learned.
- Maintain strictly between 2 and 3 active blocks in Section 3 of `memory.md`.
- Rotate the oldest blocks into `docs/CHANGELOG_HISTORY.md` (prepend at top) whenever adding a 4th block.
- Task completion requires verified build/tests and valid memory rotation.
